    <CAS:cell_ontology_term>internal globus pallidus shell projecting neuron</CAS:cell_ontology_term>
    <CAS:rationale>Mapping to the general type GPi shell neuron (internal globus pallidus shell projection neuron) is based on soma location (to GPi &amp; surrounding GPi core neurons), neurotransmitter (dual GABA-Glut), expression of sst, Sst,Tbr1,Slc17a6 and absence of Pvalb expression.</CAS:rationale>
    <CAS:rationale_dois>https://doi.org/10.1016/j.neuron.2017.03.017</CAS:rationale_dois>
    <CAS:rationale_dois>https://doi.org/10.1523/ENEURO.0208-22.2022</CAS:rationale_dois>
